  D1: the interaction energy of two unit-winding rings is dipole-dipole, U ~ 2 pi^3 F^2 a^4/d^3; the 1/d coefficient is (oint dl1).(oint dl2) = 0 exactly (Helmholtz: vorticity has no sources).
